post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'

Burning Windows has been installed.

For first use, reboot once.
Then enable/disable it from:

  Disable Fall Apart from System Settings -> Desktop Effects if enabled
  Enable System Settings -> Desktop Effects -> Burning Windows

No restart is needed for normal enable/disable after the first reboot.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}

post_remove() {
    cat <<'MSG'

Burning Windows has been removed.
Reboot if KWin still has the old plugin loaded in this session.

MSG
}
